    "description": "Are you looking to increase your buying potential?  This updated duplex is zoned multi-family, meaning it will accommodate two separate households with a possibility of potential short-term rental income with regards to the basement living space, which is attached to the lower unit (1218) and a future condo-conversion (Checking with the City of S.F. is advised).  Desirable neighborhood.  Walking distance to G.G. Park and Irving Street where there is an abundance of restaurants, coffee shops, grocery stores, etc. Recent \"freshening up\" including new kitchen cabinets, flooring, floor covering, painting inside and out and more.  Owned by the same family since original construction in 1979. Move-in ready. Unit One (Lower Unit 1218) 3 bedrooms, 2 1/2 baths, plus a \"garden apartment\" in the basement which has a full bathroom, complete kitchen and a separate entry. Unit Two (Upper unit 1220). 3 bedrooms, 2 baths."
